 Key Insights

General Health (GenHlth) is the most important predictor.
High Blood Pressure and High Cholesterol significantly influence diabetes.
BMI and Age provide moderate predictive power.
Many demographic and education-related features contribute very little.

 Conclusion

The project delivers a robust baseline ML model with strong ROC-AUC performance.
Gradient Boosting provides interpretable and stable predictions, suitable as a first version of a medical risk assessment tool.

